H5P.AdvancedText 1.1.21, H5P.Question 1.5.57, H5P.JoubelUI 1.3.46,
H5P.Components 1.0.102, H5P.Image 1.1.33, H5P.Transition 1.0.4,
H5P.FontIcons 1.0.6 (Joubel AS), FontAwesome 4.5.4 (Dave Gandy),
